      "widgets_values": [
        "Produce a precise four-view character turnaround on white using image 1 as a STRICT pose and layout template. Keep exactly four full figures on a single horizontal row, one per slot with empty gutters, identical height, feet and head fully inside each slot. Left to right: front facing the viewer, exact side profile nose pointing LEFT, opposite side profile nose pointing RIGHT, back of head facing the viewer. Keep those exact camera rotations. Replace all clothing in image 1 with the outfit shown in images 2 and 3. All four show the same girl, same hair length, body proportions, identical clothes. Ash gray-brown hair with long face-framing bangs, pale olive eyes. Wear short deep teal green capelet over a white puff-sleeved blouse, chest jabot with thin dark plum bow, grey fitted gloves, narrow dark belt, voluminous long warm ivory tiered skirt with grey floral embroidered band, grey tights and low dark shoes. Tiny white lily-of-the-valley cluster and long dark ribbon on her left temple, dangling bell earring. Match original references. Clean anime game character reference illustration, even studio lighting, no labels, characters only.",
